!/data/state/**/_metadata.json
!/data/state/**/README.md
# Data files: generated CSVs/JSONLs are runtime artifacts.
# CSV is the canonical replay source (auto_backfill appends to it daily).
# JSONL is auto-converted from CSV by the auto_backfill background task.
# fundamentals.json is reference/seed data (manually maintained).
/data/replay/*.csv
/data/replay/*.jsonl
/prompts/experiments/
/internal/experiment/prompts/
/janus-backtest
